    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-sir34">
        <head xml:id="gom-sir34-Hd1e98">Caput 34</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir34-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir34-Hd1e102">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir34-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir34-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir34_2@1-3">Quasi qui apprehendit.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir34-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-sir34-Nd1e110" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir34-Qd1e113"><seg type="qs">Significat somnia fallacia</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">ut sciant quid a bono spiritu percipiant, vel quid ab illusione patiantur.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir34-Dd1e122">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir34-Hd1e124">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir34-d1e126">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir34-Qd1e128" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir34_8@1-2">Sine mendacio.</quote>
            Abjectis somniis hortatur credendum esse doctrinae sapientiae, quae in ore fidelis viri complantata sine mendacio consummat verbum.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir34-Dd1e133">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir34-Hd1e135">Versus 9</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir34-d1e137">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1217D"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir34-Qd1e141" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir34_9@17-18">Enarrabit intellectum.</quote>
            Aliis instruendis: unde, <quote xml:id="gom-sir34-Qd1e144" source="http://scta.info/resource/IIcor1_4@1-18">Benedictus Deus, qui consolatur nos in omni tribulatione nostra, ut possimus consolari eos qui in omni pressura sunt<!-- check: Migne cites IIcor12; text matches IIcor1_4 --></quote>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir34-Dd1e150">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir34-Hd1e152">Versus 10</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir34-d1e154">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir34-Qd1e156" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir34_10@7-10">Qui autem in multis,</quote>
            etc. Mutabilis, scilicet mente, instabilis est actione. Vel, qui fidei unitate perdita multiplices sequitur haereticorum sectas, multis impietatibus servit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir34-Dd1e162">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir34-Hd1e164">Versus 12</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir34-d1e166">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir34-Qd1e168" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir34_12@5-6">Plurimas verborum</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir34-Rd1e171"><name xml:id="gom-sir34-Nd1e172" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir34-Qd1e175">Scripturam significat; qui intente Scripturam meditatur, et humiliter Dominum deprecatur, et rerum et verborum scientiam adipiscitur.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir34-Dd1e179">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir34-Hd1e181">Versus 23</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir34-d1e183">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir34-Qd1e185" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir34_23@1-2">Dona iniquorum.</quote>
            Valde detestabile est sacrificium, quod orbati patris dolori comparatur. <pb ed="#P" n="1218A"/> Quidam pensant quanta tribuunt, et non quanta rapiunt. Et congregant mercedes, et mittunt eas in saccum pertusum. In sacco pertuso videtur, quando pecunia mittitur, sed non quando amittitur. Qui ergo quanta largiuntur aspiciunt, sed non quanta rapiunt, in sacculo pertuso mercedes mittunt, quia eas in spem fiduciae suae intuentes congerunt, sed non se intuentes perdunt.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir34-Dd1e192">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir34-Hd1e194">Versus 26</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir34-d1e196">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir34-Qd1e198" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir34_26@1-2">Qui aufert.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir34-Rd1e201"><name xml:id="gom-sir34-Nd1e202" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir34-Qd1e205">In sudore vultus sui pauper acquirit panem. Qui hunc violenter tollit, quasi qui occidit proximum suum.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir34-Dd1e209">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir34-Hd1e211">Versus 28</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir34-d1e213">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir34-Qd1e215" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir34_28@1-2">Unus aedificans.</quote>
            Hoc est quod supra dixit, sacrificium de rapina non esse acceptabile. Qui offert de rapina, videtur sibi aedificium virtutum praeparere, non crimen avaritiae attendit et rapinae.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir34-Dd1e220">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir34-Hd1e222">Versus 30</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir34-d1e224">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1218B"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir34-Qd1e228" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir34_30@1-2">Qui baptizatur.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir34-Rd1e231"><name xml:id="gom-sir34-Nd1e232" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir34-Qd1e235"><seg type="qs">Lavamini</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et rursum flenda committunt.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
